# shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS

Sources: [typescript-shadcn-ui-nextjs](https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules), [tailwind.mdc](https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules)

## Stack
- shadcn/ui primitives in `frontend/components/ui/` (Radix + CVA + Tailwind)
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `frontend/lib/utils.ts`
- Tailwind only — no CSS modules or styled-components
- Dark theme default; use CSS variables (`--background`, `--foreground`, `--primary`, severity tokens)

## Component rules
- Functional components; named exports; props interfaces at file bottom or in `types.ts`
- Compose shadcn `Card`, `Badge`, `Button`, `Tabs`, `ScrollArea`, `Progress` before custom markup
- Severity colors: critical=rose, high=orange, medium=amber, low=emerald, info=indigo

## Layout & spacing
- Mobile-first breakpoints: `sm` → `md` → `lg` → `xl`
- Page shell: `max-w-7xl mx-auto`, section gap `space-y-6`, card padding `p-5` or `p-6`
- Grid: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3/4` for dashboards; never fixed pixel widths for main content

## Styling discipline
- Utility-first; `@apply` only for repeated semantic tokens in `globals.css`
- Semantic tokens over raw hex in components (`bg-card`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`)
- Subtle motion via Framer Motion: `opacity`, `y`, `scale` — duration 150–300ms, no distracting loops

## shadcn conventions
- Extend variants via CVA; don't fork Radix behavior
- Use `asChild` + `Slot` for polymorphic triggers (links styled as buttons)
- Keep accessibility defaults from Radix (focus rings, aria attributes)
